title A pass back to the goalie
intro A teammate has the ball.

setup
  lineup 7v7
  player B-CM at 33.6, 34
  ball with B-CM

step
  caption A Blue teammate has the ball.
  draw penalty-area left

step
  caption They kick it back to the goalie.
  ball to 9.5, 34
  arrow from B-CM to ball
  draw penalty-area left
  duration 1300

question
  prompt Can they pick up a kick from a teammate?
  answer No
  wrong Yes
  wrong Only outside the box
  wrong Only after a goal
  correct No pickup on a back pass.
  why A goalie cannot pick up a kick from a teammate.

question
  prompt What should they do?
  answer Use their feet
  wrong Pick it up
  wrong Throw-in
  wrong Corner kick
  correct Use their feet.
  why They have to play it with their feet.
